{"id":"d506b73ecaab7431","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection.md","title":"算术最小数与有界收集模式","display":"df-arithmetic-minimization-collection — 算术最小数与有界收集模式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection","aliases":["72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection"],"display":"df-arithmetic-minimization-collection — 算术最小数与有界收集模式","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-substitution-formula]]","[[72-df-free-variable]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II Definition1.2.2, print83–84/PDF95–96","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source schemes, parameter closure and capture avoidance checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"在收集模式的集合枚举中显式保留界项与不同输入变量条件"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-minimization-collection — 算术最小数与有界收集模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fd59a2f2c3a81c3\" href=\"?note=3fd59a2f2c3a81c3\" title=\"72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy\">72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bab190ea1c0904c8\" href=\"?note=bab190ea1c0904c8\" title=\"72-df-substitution-formula\">72-df-substitution-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdc2c33e939db2f8\" href=\"?note=fdc2c33e939db2f8\" title=\"72-df-free-variable\">72-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II Definition1.2.2, print83–84/PDF95–96"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source schemes, parameter closure and capture avoidance checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"在收集模式的集合枚举中显式保留界项与不同输入变量条件"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3fd59a2f2c3a81c3\" href=\"?note=3fd59a2f2c3a81c3\" title=\"72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy\">72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy</a> 的语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Phi\">\\(A\\in\\Phi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>、x≠y；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\)</span> 且 x 不出现在 t 中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}\">\\(\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fdc2c33e939db2f8\" href=\"?note=fdc2c33e939db2f8\" title=\"72-df-free-variable\">72-df-free-variable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[u/x]\">\\(A[u/x]\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bab190ea1c0904c8\" href=\"?note=bab190ea1c0904c8\" title=\"72-df-substitution-formula\">72-df-substitution-formula</a> 的捕获避免代入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_{A,x}\">\\(m_{A,x}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_{A,x,y,t}\">\\(z_{A,x,y,t}\\)</span> 用固定变量枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> 选取最小下标的新鲜变量。</li>\n<li>所有模式经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span> 封闭；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u&lt;x\">\\(u&lt;x\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\le x\\land u\\ne x\">\\(u\\le x\\land u\\ne x\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m_{A,x}:=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}},\\quad\nz_{A,x,y,t}:=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m_{A,x}:=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}},\\quad\nz_{A,x,y,t}:=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}\\bigl[(\\exists xA)\\to\n\\exists x(A\\land\\forall m_{A,x}(m_{A,x}&lt;x\\to\\neg A[m_{A,x}/x]))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{COL}_{x,y,t}(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}\\bigl[((\\forall x\\le t)\\exists yA)\\to\n\\exists z_{A,x,y,t}(\\forall x\\le t)(\\exists y\\le z_{A,x,y,t})A\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{MIN}(\\Phi)&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{COL}(\\Phi)&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{COL}_{x,y,t}(A):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ x\\ne y,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}),\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(t)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}\\bigl[(\\exists xA)\\to\n\\exists x(A\\land\\forall m_{A,x}(m_{A,x}&lt;x\\to\\neg A[m_{A,x}/x]))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{COL}_{x,y,t}(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}\\bigl[((\\forall x\\le t)\\exists yA)\\to\n\\exists z_{A,x,y,t}(\\forall x\\le t)(\\exists y\\le z_{A,x,y,t})A\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{MIN}(\\Phi)&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{COL}(\\Phi)&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{COL}_{x,y,t}(A):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ x\\ne y,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}),\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(t)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取全称闭包保留全部自由参数。MIN 不仅要求一个见证，还排除更小见证；COL 对有界多个输入给共同数值上界，不要求见证唯一，因此不是函数选择的唯一性模式。显示集合枚举只取 Hypothesis 中列明的合法新鲜变量与界项输入。</p>\n<p>逐式回查后用最小下标选择代替“任取新鲜变量”：本语言是自由树而非未指定的 α 商，故同一函数输入必须给唯一语法输出。有限排除集保证两个最小值存在。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"3fd59a2f2c3a81c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"bab190ea1c0904c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"fdc2c33e939db2f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"3fd59a2f2c3a81c3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]] 的语言；$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})$，$A\\in\\Phi$，$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$、x≠y；$t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})$ 且 x 不出现在 t 中。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"fdc2c33e939db2f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}$ 取 [[72-df-free-variable]]；$A[u/x]$ 使用 [[72-df-substitution-formula]] 的捕获避免代入。$m_{A,x}$、$z_{A,x,y,t}$ 用固定变量枚举 $v_i$ 选取最小下标的新鲜变量。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"bab190ea1c0904c8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}$ 取 [[72-df-free-variable]]；$A[u/x]$ 使用 [[72-df-substitution-formula]] 的捕获避免代入。$m_{A,x}$、$z_{A,x,y,t}$ 用固定变量枚举 $v_i$ 选取最小下标的新鲜变量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}","display":false},{"tex":"A[u/x]","display":false},{"tex":"m_{A,x}","display":false},{"tex":"z_{A,x,y,t}","display":false},{"tex":"v_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"u<x","display":false},{"tex":"u\\le x\\land u\\ne x","display":false},{"tex":"m_{A,x}:=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}},\\quad\nz_{A,x,y,t}:=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A)&:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}\\bigl[(\\exists xA)\\to\n\\exists x(A\\land\\forall m_{A,x}(m_{A,x}<x\\to\\neg A[m_{A,x}/x]))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{COL}_{x,y,t}(A)&:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}\\bigl[((\\forall x\\le t)\\exists yA)\\to\n\\exists z_{A,x,y,t}(\\forall x\\le t)(\\exists y\\le z_{A,x,y,t})A\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{MIN}(\\Phi)&:=\\{\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{COL}(\\Phi)&:=\\{\\operatorname{COL}_{x,y,t}(A):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ x\\ne y,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}),\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}(t)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3114,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增5项：[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]] · [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]] · [[72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions]] · [[72-thm-arithmetic-induction-collection-chain]]"},{"id":"44d76667d32d9bbd","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"基础 $Q^{\\le},I\\Delta_0$ 取 [[72-df-i-delta-0]]，归纳模式取 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]，普通层级与最小数、收集模式取 [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]]。$n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增5项：[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]] · [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]] · [[72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions]] · [[72-thm-arithmetic-induction-collection-chain]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-492","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增5项：[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]] · [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]] · [[72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions]] · [[72-thm-arithmetic-induction-collection-chain]]"},{"id":"2aef4b22374aba29","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3fd59a2f2c3a81c3","bab190ea1c0904c8","fdc2c33e939db2f8"]}